    "intro": "Lenticule Science is the research company of the 561 Group. It publishes research on paraconsistent (four-valued) logic, concurrent AI-agent integration, the MAPE-K autonomic loop, x402 machine-payable markets, organizational science (Rendanheyi) and formal mathematics in Lean 4. Each publication separates what is proved or measured from what is hypothesized, and states its limits. Papers carry structured citations; glossary pages give short definitions.",
